{"5122180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombo Mode", "steam_appid": 5122180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombo Mode excels at what other FPS games lack. This Shooter experience may lack in fancy graphics,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it gives the player back his most essential abilities. Like holding 2 guns at once... or chopping off your buddy's head and kicking it around (in the game).</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombo Mode excels at what other FPS games lack. This Shooter experience may lack in fancy graphics,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it gives the player back his most essential abilities. Like holding 2 guns at once... or chopping off your buddy's head and kicking it around (in the game).</p>", "short_description": "Take Zombie-Killing matters into your own two hands, with friends online - or by yourself. There's something to keep you busy whether or not your friends are online. Are you the first guy online? Make a custom zombo mode. Then when the homies get on, see what they think of the crazy mode you made.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122180/9739793ebcae0d54e3f08d98d91955730373cb13/header.jpg?t=1788158095", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122180/7b096d636a74af726387152645b4eac4f5ef56fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788158095", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122180/7b096d636a74af726387152645b4eac4f5ef56fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788158095", "website": "https://zombomode.ca/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Pr